    },
    {
        "text": "You can do it! Lord!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hnng... Grrrgh! Gah...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#10"
    },
    {
        "text": "Almost! Just a little more!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... Hah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... It's very impressive you can pull back this crossbow with your bare hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a design. You couldn't tell by looking at it that this crossbow has such tensile strength.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a pretty ordinary crossbow. Most Sarkaz can lock it barehanded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A heavy crossbow with this kind of power... at least than one hundred meters, it won't be that different from a gun. It's just too much work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "...And I already learned the hard way that bit about our physical differences.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "That zappy girl over there might be no weaker than me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you talking about Liskarm? She's a Vouivre. They're a strong race, for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why the sudden interest in these weapons?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're expecting a lot of fights soon, so it's time to think about what to do when we run out of ammo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without bullets, my gun might as well be a paperweight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think we can take them hand-to-hand when it comes to that. And our training and experience won't be enough either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How much do we have left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not much over here. Not even four hundred rounds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me show you something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this a... bullet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a bullet that Rhodes Islander named Liskarm uses. They call it an 'etched bullet,' and it's apparently an extremely expensive commodity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you take it apart yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's it made of? What's the propellant?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This chunk of crystal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like an energy source. Is that a propellant or a warhead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Laterano gunsmith once told me that every single etched bullet contains a miniature casting unit that matches up with the structure of a Laterano gun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "That means it's not only the gun, but every etched bullet, is basically a caster's staff. That's why they're so expensive, and why they need such complicated Arts that only Sankta can make much use of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Other peoples go with easier ranged weapons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So Laterano is the name of the country, Sankta is the name of the race. Laterano people are not necessarily Sankta... Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's real bad news about the bullets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do we have any gun here that doesn't require those 'Originium Arts' to work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never heard about those firearms that don't need Originium Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sigh)...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "One step at a time. At least everybody can use explosives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did K\u00f6tz go with them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They're in the basement. Still trying to fix the thing that looks like a radio transmitter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
